# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid "Installation instructions for the latest version of Shaded lightcones"
msgstr "Pokyny k instalaci nejnovější verze Shaded lightcones"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Installation instructions"
msgstr "Pokyny k instalaci"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title #
#, no-wrap
msgid "Installation instructions {#installation-instructions}"
msgstr "Pokyny k instalaci {#installation-instructions}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "First, choose how you’re going to run and install the packages. There are two primary ways to do this:\n"
msgstr "Nejprve si vyber, jak budeš balíčky spouštět a instalovat. Existují dva hlavní způsoby:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '*   '
#, no-wrap
msgid "[Option 1: Install from PyPI](#option-1)\n"
msgstr "[Možnost 1: Instalace z PyPI](#option-1)\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '*   '
#, no-wrap
msgid "[Option 2: Install from Source](#option-2)\n"
msgstr "[Možnost 2: Instalace ze zdroje](#option-2)\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Prerequisites {#prerequisites}"
msgstr "Předpoklady {#prerequisites}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "First, create a minimal environment with only Python installed in it. We recommend using [Python virtual environments](https://docs.python.org/3/tutorial/venv.html).\n"
msgstr "Nejprve vytvoř minimální prostředí, ve kterém je nainstalován pouze Python. Doporučujeme použít [virtuální prostředí Pythonu](https://docs.python.org/3/tutorial/venv.html).\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Activate your new environment.\n"
msgstr "Aktivuj své nové prostředí.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"option-1\" />\n"
msgstr ""

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Option 1: Install from PyPI {#option-1-install-from-pypi}"
msgstr "Možnost 1: Instalace z PyPI {#option-1-install-from-pypi}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The most straightforward way to install the `qiskit-addon-slc` package is via `PyPI`.\n"
msgstr "Nejpřímější způsob instalace balíčku `qiskit-addon-slc` je přes `PyPI`.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"option-2\" />\n"
msgstr ""

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Option 2: Install from Source {#option-2-install-from-source}"
msgstr "Možnost 2: Instalace ze zdroje {#option-2-install-from-source}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "If you plan to develop in the repository or run the notebooks locally, install from source.\n"
msgstr "Pokud plánuješ vyvíjet v repozitáři nebo spouštět notebooky lokálně, nainstaluj ze zdroje.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "If so, the first step is to clone the `qiskit-addon-slc` repository.\n"
msgstr "Pokud ano, prvním krokem je naklonovat repozitář `qiskit-addon-slc`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Next, upgrade `pip` and enter the repository.\n"
msgstr "Dále aktualizuj `pip` a přejdi do repozitáře.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The next step is to install `qiskit-addon-slc` to the virtual environment. Install the notebook dependencies if you plan to run all the visualizations in the notebooks. If you plan on developing in the repository, install the `dev` dependencies.\n"
msgstr "Dalším krokem je nainstalovat `qiskit-addon-slc` do virtuálního prostředí. Pokud plánuješ spouštět všechny vizualizace v noteboocích, nainstaluj závislosti pro notebooky. Pokud plánuješ vyvíjet v repozitáři, nainstaluj závislosti `dev`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Adjust the options below to suit your needs.\n"
msgstr "Upravte níže uvedené možnosti podle svých potřeb.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "If you installed the notebook dependencies, you can get started by running the notebooks in the docs.\n"
msgstr "Pokud jsi nainstaloval závislosti pro notebooky, můžeš začít spuštěním notebooků v dokumentaci.\n"
